# CODEOWNERS — AI control-plane protection
#
# Purpose: make changes to the AI operating system's control plane humanly
# reviewable at the platform layer, independent of what any agent runtime
# permits locally (CORE §47 AI Governance, §48 Self-Modification Boundary).
#
# Scope note: this file assigns ownership and triggers review requests. It only
# *blocks* a merge if branch protection enables "Require review from Code
# Owners" — which is deliberately NOT enabled today. See ADR-0010 for the
# reasoning and the consequence for single-owner pull requests.
#
# Canonical rationale: docs/decisions/2026-08-22-ai-os-v1-hardening.md

# Default: no global owner. Ownership is declared per control-plane path only,
# so ordinary application changes are not gated by this file.

# --- Project policy and runtime entry points ---------------------------------
/AGENTS.md                      @jeffnawroth
/CLAUDE.md                      @jeffnawroth
/.github/copilot-instructions.md @jeffnawroth

# --- Runtime adapter configuration -------------------------------------------
/.claude/                       @jeffnawroth
/.opencode/                     @jeffnawroth
/opencode.json                  @jeffnawroth
/.mcp.json                      @jeffnawroth

# --- Normative AI-OS documentation and decision records ----------------------
/docs/ai-os/                    @jeffnawroth
/docs/decisions/                @jeffnawroth

# --- Governance checks and evaluation evidence -------------------------------
/evaluation/ai-system/          @jeffnawroth

# --- This file protects itself -----------------------------------------------
/.github/CODEOWNERS             @jeffnawroth
